# replacearr.com

Public marketing site for Replacearr. React 19 + Vite multi-page SPA. Repo: `github.com/replacearr/replacearr.com`. Product code stays in the sibling `replacearr` repo.

## Layout

- `src/pages/` — Home, Product, Install, Gallery
- `src/components/SiteShell.tsx` — sticky nav + footer shell
- `src/styles/tokens.css` + `layout.css` — design tokens and shared primitives
- `public/images/{logos,desktop,mobile}/` — brand mark and UI screenshots
- `public/CNAME` — `replacearr.com`
- `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` — Pages build/deploy
- `AGENTS.md` — agent map

## Invariants

- Marketing SPA only. No Go API, SQLite, auth, or second UI framework.
- Plain CSS only (no Tailwind, no styled-components).
- Stack: React 19, Vite, `react-router-dom`, `motion`, `lucide-react`.
- Light teal/ink visual system (see design-system). No background video.
- Brand is **Replacearr**. CTAs: GitHub, Docker Hub, Discord.
- Sonarr / Radarr / Prowlarr are mentioned only as the replaced stack — never as outbound links.
- Assets live under `public/images/` (sourced from `replacearr/images/`).
- Never commit `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `.env`, or secrets.
- Build must copy `dist/index.html` → `dist/404.html` for GitHub Pages SPA routes.

## Commands

```bash
npm run dev
npm run typecheck
npm run build
```
